            <text x='628' y='207' fontSize='14' fill='#FFFFFF' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Inter'>8 题</text>
            <text x='628' y='235' fontSize='13' fill='#FDF0DC' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Inter'>文件 / 异常 /</text>
            <text x='628' y='255' fontSize='13' fill='#FDF0DC' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Inter'>JSON / pytest</text>
